                                "sense_id": "ab86d8fc-fb72-3a62-97e6-e73661329733",
                                "text": "As Bezos describes it, AMI threatened to publish the photos if Bezos failed to make a public statement that he had “no knowledge or basis for suggesting that AMI’s coverage was politically motivated or influenced by political forces.”"
